%h2
  Invitation Expiring on
  =@expiration_date

%p We've had a surprisingly large number of invite requests for our free boxes.
%p Unfortunately, this means we cannot accommodate all of the invites for our free tier.
%p
  We'll be expiring invites that aren't accepted by
  %b= @expiration_date
  , so sign up now!

%p Please click the following link to activate your account:
:ruby
  _reg_url = new_user_registration_url(email: @invite.email, invite_code: @invite.invite_code)

%p= link_to _reg_url, _reg_url

%p If you've forgotten, Nitrous.IO (formerly Action.IO) is a cloud development platform that provides a lightning fast way to setup and manage development environments in the cloud.

%p Want some reasons why you should sign up?

%ul
  %li Web IDE so you can code from anywhere
  %li Support for Ruby/Rails, Python/Django, Node.JS and Go
  %li SSH into your box and use Vim or Emacs
  %li Development boxes are free for our private beta

%p Feel free to ping me personally if you have any questions about the platform.

%p AJ Solimine
%p Nitrous.IO

= mixpanel_pixel_track 'Invite Reminder Sent', @invite.email
